        },

        {
            "name": "4. Validaton & Enrich",
            "function": "aaosa_call",
            "instructions": """
{instructions_prefix}
The name of this app is 4. Validaton & Enrich.
**Purpose:** Ensure all MiFIR-required fields are present and enriched.
**Output & Actions:**
- Compare FpML input with MiFIR requirements.
- Identify and fetch missing fields from static data (e.g., LEI, trading capacity).
- Output enriched trade data and a validation report.


{aaosa_instructions}
            """,
            "command": "aaosa_command",
            "tools": ["5. XML Compliance"]
        },                

        {
            "name": "3ba. XML Generator",
            "function": "aaosa_call",
            "instructions": """
{instructions_prefix}
The name of this app is 3ba. XML Generator.
**Output & Actions:**
- Generate XML reports from enriched trade data according to the AFM MiFIR schema.
- Validate XML before submission.
{aaosa_instructions}
            """,
            "command": "aaosa_command",
            "tools": ["5. XML Compliance"]
        },  

        {
            "name": "3bb. Eligibility Logic",
            "function": "aaosa_call",
            "instructions": """
{instructions_prefix}
The name of this app is 3bb. Eligibility Logic.
**Output & Actions:**
- Assess MiFIR eligibility based on regulatory rules.
{aaosa_instructions}
            """,
            "command": "aaosa_command",
            "tools": ["5. XML Compliance"]
        },  

        {
            "name": "5. XML Compliance",
            "function": "aaosa_call",
            "instructions": """
{instructions_prefix}
The name of this app is 5. XML Compliance.
**Purpose:** Validate generated XML against the AFM MiFIR schema.
**Output & Actions:**
- Run schema validation on generated XML.
- Suggest and apply corrections for non-compliance.
- Output validated, compliant XML files.


{aaosa_instructions}
            """,
            "command": "aaosa_command",
            "tools": ["6. Submission"]
        },  

        {
            "name": "3ca. SFTP Client",
            "function": "aaosa_call",
            "instructions": """
{instructions_prefix}
The name of this app is 3ca. SFTP Client.
**Output & Actions:**
- Submit XML files via SFTP to an ARM endpoint.
- Implement retry logic and log submission results.
{aaosa_instructions}
            """,
            "command": "aaosa_command",
            "tools": ["6. Submission"]
        },

        {
            "name": "6. Submission",
            "function": "aaosa_call",
            "instructions": """
{instructions_prefix}
The name of this app is 6. Submission.
**Purpose:** Securely submit XML reports via SFTP and log results.
**Output & Actions:**
- Handle SFTP submission with retry and status logging.
- Store submission results and XML in the database.
- Output submission logs and status reports.


{aaosa_instructions}
            """,
            "command": "aaosa_command",
            "tools": ["7. Monitor & ErrorHand"]
        },  

        {
            "name": "3da. Log & Monitor",
            "function": "aaosa_call",
